{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nizero Shogi&quot; is a shogi game where you can build decks from over 300 types of pieces, including powerful and diverse pieces that appeared in old shogi such as Taikyoku Shogi, pieces from overseas shogi such as Chess and Xiangqi, and pieces with special effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also supports four-player shogi, which allows you to experience unique developments different from two-player games, and we are holding events where you can play irregular shogi for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be updating it from time to time with the aim of creating &quot;Shogi Version 2.0&quot; that brings together shogi from the past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings have also been implemented for each mode, so if there is a shogi rule that you are good at, please try to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is possible to play cross-platform online with the smartphone version!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896320?t=1754985663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896320?t=1754985663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896320/e3912e6051019bb98649ee158c986fc5370306c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754985663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896320/e3912e6051019bb98649ee158c986fc5370306c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754985663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Nizero Shogi&quot; is a shogi game where you can build decks from over 300 types of pieces, including powerful and diverse pieces that appeared in old shogi such as Taikyoku Shogi, pieces from overseas shogi such as Chess and Xiangqi, and pieces with special effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It also supports four-player shogi, which allows you to experience unique developments different from two-player games, and we are holding events where you can play irregular shogi for a limited time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be updating it from time to time with the aim of creating &quot;Shogi Version 2.0&quot; that brings together shogi from the past, present, and future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings have also been implemented for each mode, so if there is a shogi rule that you are good at, please try to reach the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is possible to play cross-platform online with the smartphone version!</p>","developers":["\u9ad8\u7802\u30bb\u30f2\u30a4"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896320/f68441ce2a617a20310ffe58edd3e35bad5fb5a3/header.jpg?t=1754985663","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ventura 13\u4ee5\u4e0a<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7, Apple M4 \u52d5\u4f5c\u78ba\u8a8d\u6e08<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB\u4ee5\u4e0a<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Seqquoia 15\u4ee5\u4e0a<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1.5GB\u4ee5\u4e0a<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3896320/372859637/9ec8174f26e29970eb75a3ab3127bb3b2b92141f/1753886944/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753887774","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.